{"sha": "e0df1da8c12748ea3c62d486e0fa34654101d41143a69f612e29ed26471b3fde", "body": ["\\begin{omfigure}", "\\begin{tikzpicture}[font=\\small, x=1cm, y=1cm, >=Stealth]", "  \\begin{scope}", "    % Venturi", "    \\draw[thick] (-2.6,0.7) -- (-1.2,0.7) -- (-0.3,0.3) -- (0.5,0.3) -- (1.4,0.7) -- (2.6,0.7);", "    \\draw[thick] (-2.6,-0.7) -- (-1.2,-0.7) -- (-0.3,-0.3) -- (0.5,-0.3) -- (1.4,-0.7) -- (2.6,-0.7);", "    \\draw[omThm, thick, ->] (-2.3,0) -- (-1.5,0) node[above, font=\\footnotesize] {$v_1$};", "    \\draw[omThm, thick, ->] (-0.5,0) -- (0.9,0) node[above, font=\\footnotesize, yshift=-1pt] {$v_2$};", "    % manometer", "    \\draw[thick] (-1.8,0.7) -- (-1.8,1.2) -- (-1.8,2.2); \\draw[thick] (0.1,0.3) -- (0.1,2.2);", "    \\draw[thick] (-1.8,1.2) -- (-1.8,1.25); ", "    \\fill[omDef!40] (-1.85,0.7) rectangle (-1.75,1.9); \\fill[omDef!40] (0.05,0.3) rectangle (0.15,1.2);", "    \\draw[<->] (0.5,1.2) -- (0.5,1.9) node[midway, right, font=\\footnotesize] {$\\Delta h$};", "    \\draw[dashed] (-1.8,1.9) -- (0.5,1.9); \\draw[dashed] (0.1,1.2) -- (0.5,1.2);", "    \\node[font=\\footnotesize] at (0,-1.2) {文丘里：$P_1 - P_2 = \\tfrac12\\rho(v_2^2 - v_1^2)$};", "  \\end{scope}", "  \\begin{scope}[xshift=6.6cm]", "    % Pitot", "    % outer tube with rounded nose, static holes on the side", "    \\draw[thick] (-1.0,0.3) -- (1.8,0.3) (-1.0,-0.3) -- (1.8,-0.3);", "    \\draw[thick] (-1.0,0.3) arc[start angle=90, end angle=270, radius=0.3];", "    % inner (stagnation) tube", "    \\draw[thick] (-1.3,0.08) -- (1.4,0.08) (-1.3,-0.08) -- (1.4,-0.08);", "    \\fill[white] (-1.32,0.07) rectangle (-1.28,-0.07);", "    \\draw[thick] (1.4,0.08) -- (1.4,1.0) node[above, font=\\footnotesize] {$P_{\\text{滞止}}$};", "    \\draw[thick] (1.56,0.08) -- (1.56,-0.08);", "    \\draw[thick] (1.4,0.08) -- (1.56,0.08); \\draw[thick] (1.4,-0.08) -- (1.56,-0.08);", "    % static holes and their tube", "    \\fill[white] (0.2,0.27) rectangle (0.35,0.33); \\fill[white] (0.2,-0.27) rectangle (0.35,-0.33);", "    \\draw[thick] (0.6,0.3) -- (0.6,1.0) node[above, font=\\footnotesize] {$P$};", "    \\foreach \\y in {0.75,-0.75} \\draw[omThm, thick, ->] (-2.7,\\y) -- (-1.7,\\y);", "    \\draw[omThm, thick, ->] (-2.7,0) -- (-1.6,0) node[above, font=\\footnotesize, pos=0.3] {$v$};", "    \\fill[omDef] (-1.3,0) circle (1.2pt);", "    \\node[font=\\footnotesize] at (0,-1.2) {皮托管：$P_{\\text{滞止}} - P = \\tfrac12\\rho v^2$};", "  \\end{scope}", "  \\begin{scope}[xshift=11.6cm]", "    \\draw[thick] (-1.3,-0.9) -- (-1.3,1.6) (-1.3,-0.9) -- (1.0,-0.9) -- (1.0,-0.5) (1.0,-0.2) -- (1.0,1.6);", "    \\fill[omDef!15] (-1.3,-0.9) rectangle (1.0,1.3); \\draw[omDef, thick] (-1.3,1.3) -- (1.0,1.3);", "    \\draw[omThm, thick, ->] (1.0,-0.35) -- (1.9,-0.35) node[right, font=\\footnotesize] {$v$};", "    \\draw[<->] (1.35,1.3) -- (1.35,-0.2) node[midway, right, font=\\footnotesize] {$h$};", "    \\node[font=\\footnotesize] at (0,-1.35) {托里拆利：$v = \\sqrt{2gh}$};", "  \\end{scope}", "\\end{tikzpicture}", "", "{\\small 伯努利定理的三个应用。左：文丘里流量计 --- 压差计读数", "即为喉部的压降，由此得出流量。中：皮托管 ---", "驻点压强超出侧孔静压强的部分，", "即为动压强。右：托里拆利出流，", "其速率即为自由落体速率。}", "\\end{omfigure}", "", "\\begin{example}[数值]\\label{ex:b2:euler-bernoulli:numbers}", "水管上一段文丘里管，管径由 \\qty{5}{cm} 收窄至 \\qty{2.5}{cm}，", "其中水柱高差 $\\Delta h = \\qty{20}{cm}$（\\qty{2.0}{kPa}）：$v_1 = \\sqrt{2 \\times 2000/", "(1000 \\times 15)} = \\qty{0.52}{m/s}$，$D_V = \\qty{1.0}{L/s}$。一架客机在", "\\qty{11}{km} 高空（$\\rho = \\qty{0.36}{kg/m^3}$），速率为 \\qty{250}{m/s}：动压强", "\\qty{11}{kPa}，占环境压强的 $11\\%$ --- 皮托管仍然", "可用，但需作可压缩性修正。水塔位于水龙头上方 \\qty{40}{m}", "处：关闭时压强为 \\qty{4}{bar}，若全部打开，射流速率为", "\\qty{28}{m/s}（实际要小得多：管道并非理想）。", "\\end{example}", "", "\\begin{proposition}[机翼升力]\\label{prop:b2:euler-bernoulli:lift}", "\\index{升力}\\index{库塔--茹可夫斯基定理}\\index{马格努斯效应}", "在机翼周围的流动中，空气流经上表面比下表面更快；", "因而上方压强低于下方，其合力即为\\emph{升力} $F_L =", "\\tfrac12\\rho v^2SC_L$（$S$ 为机翼面积，$C_L \\approx 0.3$--$1.5$ 为升力", "系数，取决于翼型与迎角）。速度差等效于绕翼型速度的", "\\emph{环量} $\\Gamma$，单位展长的升力为 $F_L' =", "\\rho v\\Gamma$（库塔--茹可夫斯基定理，在本阶段不加证明地承认）。", "旋转的球会带动周围空气一同转动，", "因而受到侧向的力，", "这便是切削网球与弧线任意球中的", "\\emph{马格努斯效应}。", "\\end{proposition}", "", "\\begin{proof}", "在上方与下方紧邻的两条流线上应用伯努利定理，", "二者起始于相同的上游条件：$P_{\\text{下}} - P_{\\text{上}} = \\tfrac12\\rho", "(v_{\\text{上}}^2 - v_{\\text{下}}^2)$；沿弦长积分。上方流动为何更快 ---", "尖锐的后缘迫使后驻点位于该处，", "并确定环量（库塔条件）。这超出了", "单独理想流体模型的范围，", "需要用到下一章的边界层理论。", "\\end{proof}", "", "\\begin{omfigure}", "\\begin{tikzpicture}[font=\\small, x=1cm, y=1cm, >=Stealth]", "  \\begin{scope}", "    % airfoil", "    \\draw[thick, fill=omExo!20, rotate=-8] (-2.0,0) .. controls (-1.5,0.55) and (0.5,0.5) .. (2.0,0.0) .. controls (0.5,-0.15) and (-1.5,-0.2) .. (-2.0,0);", "    \\foreach \\y/\\s in {1.25/1.0, 0.95/1.0, -0.75/1.0, -1.1/1.0} {", "      \\draw[omDef, thick, postaction={decorate, decoration={markings, mark=at position 0.5 with {\\arrow{>}}}}] (-3.2,\\y) .. controls (-1.5,\\y) and (-0.5,{\\y+0.25*(\\y>0)-0.1*(\\y<0)}) .. (3.2,{\\y-0.15});", "    }", "    \\draw[omDef, thick, postaction={decorate, decoration={markings, mark=at position 0.25 with {\\arrow{>}}}}] (-3.2,0.55) .. controls (-2.2,0.55) and (-1.2,0.95) .. (0,0.85) .. controls (1.2,0.75) and (2.2,0.1) .. (3.2,-0.0);", "    \\draw[omDef, thick, postaction={decorate, decoration={markings, mark=at position 0.25 with {\\arrow{>}}}}] (-3.2,-0.35) .. controls (-2.2,-0.35) and (-1.2,-0.45) .. (0,-0.5) .. controls (1.2,-0.55) and (2.2,-0.45) .. (3.2,-0.4);", "    \\node[omThm, font=\\footnotesize] at (-0.2,1.65) {流速快，$P$ 低};", "    \\node[omThm, font=\\footnotesize] at (-0.2,-1.5) {流速慢，$P$ 高};", "    \\draw[omThm, very thick, ->] (0,0.05) -- (0,1.05) node[right, font=\\footnotesize, pos=0.7] {$\\vect F_L$};", "    \\node[font=\\footnotesize] at (0,-2.0) {$F_L' = \\rho v\\Gamma$};", "  \\end{scope}", "  \\begin{scope}[xshift=8.2cm]", "    % U-tube", "    \\draw[thick] (-1.2,2.0) -- (-1.2,-0.4) arc[start angle=180, end angle=360, radius=1.2] -- (1.2,2.0);", "    \\draw[thick] (-0.6,2.0) -- (-0.6,-0.4) arc[start angle=180, end angle=360, radius=0.6] -- (0.6,2.0);", "    \\fill[omDef!25] (-1.2,1.3) -- (-1.2,-0.4) arc[start angle=180, end angle=360, radius=1.2] -- (1.2,0.7) -- (0.6,0.7) -- (0.6,-0.4) arc[start angle=360, end angle=180, radius=0.6] -- (-0.6,1.3) -- cycle;", "    \\draw[omDef, thick] (-1.2,1.3) -- (-0.6,1.3); \\draw[omDef, thick] (0.6,0.7) -- (1.2,0.7);", "    \\draw[dashed] (-1.5,1.0) -- (1.5,1.0);", "    \\draw[<->] (1.45,1.0) -- (1.45,0.7) node[midway, right, font=\\footnotesize] {$z$};", "    \\draw[<->] (-1.45,1.0) -- (-1.45,1.3) node[midway, left, font=\\footnotesize] {$z$};", "    \\node[font=\\footnotesize] at (0,-2.0) {$\\ddot z + \\dfrac{2g}{L}z = 0$};", "  \\end{scope}", "\\end{tikzpicture}", ""]}